UTherm 0.1.0

Copyright 2025-2026 Sashank Silwal.

UTherm contains and modifies code from SOLWEIG-GPU, copyright 2022-2025
Harsh Kamath and Naveen Sudharsan. SOLWEIG-GPU is derived from the SOLWEIG
model distributed with UMEP. The upstream project is available at:

https://github.com/nvnsudharsan/SOLWEIG-GPU

The principal UTherm additions are the surface, roof and canopy energy-balance
modules, spatial air-temperature methods, and coupled radiative geometry.

